    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "18f888f817f643d5",
      "x": 58,
      "y": 1076,
      "width": 1324,
      "height": 45.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 84196940,
      "versionNonce": 2065920251,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789132699951,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE SPLIT \u2014 plan.json carries two kinds of thing and they never meet again until the canvas.   GLYPH \u2192 FLUX, wordless, one noun phrase per anchor.   LABEL \u00b7 NOTE \u00b7 TITLE \u2192 drawn straight onto Excalidraw as TEXT,\ncrisp and editable.        NOTE ON digest.md: it is the digest rendered FOR A HUMAN. Nothing downstream reads it \u2014 the planner reads digest.json, and FLUX never sees the digest at all.        EVERY <run> IS\nui/output/<provider>-<model>_digest_<timestamp>/",
      "originalText": "THE SPLIT \u2014 plan.json carries two kinds of thing and they never meet again until the canvas.   GLYPH \u2192 FLUX, wordless, one noun phrase per anchor.   LABEL \u00b7 NOTE \u00b7 TITLE \u2192 drawn straight onto Excalidraw as TEXT,\ncrisp and editable.        NOTE ON digest.md: it is the digest rendered FOR A HUMAN. Nothing downstream reads it \u2014 the planner reads digest.json, and FLUX never sees the digest at all.        EVERY <run> IS\nui/output/<provider>-<model>_digest_<timestamp>/",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 10
    }
  ],
